
  ! fast-forward: 2 done · 8 unchanged · 4 skipped

  Fast-forward  feat/all (1 commit), feat/dry (1 commit)
  Up to date    main, feat/ahead (ahead of origin), feat/behind, feat/dirty, feat/fp, feat/json, feat/quiet, feat/uptodate
  Left as is    feat/clash (uncommitted changes), feat/diverged (diverged from origin), feat/noremote (not on origin), feat/rebasing (an operation is under way)

  ! feat/clash has uncommitted changes: left as it is
  ! feat/diverged has diverged from origin (1 ahead, 1 behind): left as it is
  ! origin has no branch feat/noremote: nothing to fast-forward it to
  ! feat/rebasing is in the middle of an operation (rebasing): left as it is

  → wtm fast-forward feat/clash --force   fast-forward it anyway
  → wtm sync feat/diverged                     rebase it
  → wtm go feat/rebasing                       finish it in the worktree

